OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FMiriam Lewin was a 'disappeared'
OL,7,     Fpolitical prisoner in 1978 when
OL,8,     FArgentina won its controversial
OL,9,     FWorld Cup - she was made to cheer
OL,10,     Fin the streets, then put back in
OL,11,     Fdetention.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1967, an American lineman
OL,14,     Fclimbed a power pole to give his
OL,15,     Fcolleague mouth-to-mouth. The
OL,16,     Fmoment was captured in a
OL,17,     Fprize-winning photo.
